es (command outputs, extracted snippets) into docs/case-studies/issue-2591/data/cli-model-catalogues/ (e.g. gemini-0.62.0-aliases.txt, qwen-0.24.7-models.txt, agent-0.26.11-models.txt, opencode-1.18.34-models.txt). Keep each file small (<200 lines, only relevant snippets).\n\nFinal answer: a concise report (<= 60 lines) per CLI: current models, default, aliases + what they resolve to, obsolete bundled entries, missing entries, recommended catalogue changes; cite the evidence file names.",
