ode/kimi-k2.5-free': 'opencode/kimi-k2.5-free', // Deprecated\n418\t  'opencode/glm-4.7-free': 'opencode/glm-4.7-free', // Deprecated\n419\t  'opencode/minimax-m2.1-free': 'opencode/minimax-m2.1-free', // Deprecated\n420\t  'anthropic/claude-3-5-sonnet': 'anthropic/claude-3-5-sonnet',\n421\t  'anthropic/claude-3-5-haiku': 'anthropic/claude-3-5-haiku',\n422\t  'anthropic/claude-3-opus': 'anthropic/claude-3-opus',\n423\t  'google/gemini-3-pro': 'google/gemini-3-pro',\n424\t};\n425\t"
