        "tool_use_id": "toolu_01WSjZ4N6YgeXYEiYDXjhC93",
        "type": "tool_result",
        "content": "## Problem\n\n`opencode/nemotron-3-super-free` is no longer served by OpenCode Zen, but `@link-assistant/agent@0.26.11` still documents it as a free model and uses it in the default compaction cascade. An explicit `--model opencode/nemotron-3-super-free` (or `nemotron-3-super-free`) is refused before the first turn.\n\nThis is the same situation as #242 (when `qwen3.6-plus-free` was withdrawn).\n\n## Evidence\n\n**1. Live model list.** On 2026-10-02, `curl -s https://opencode.ai/zen/v1/models` returned these free ids:\n\n```\nbig-pickle, jev-1.13-free, deepseek-v4-flash-free, muse-spark-1.3-contributor-free, muse-spark-1.2-contributor-free,\nmimo-v2.6-flash-free, space-bunny-free, longcat-2.5-preview-free, mimo-v2.5-free, ling-3.0-flash-fin-free,\nnemotron-3-ultra-free, nemotron-3.5-lightning-free, fledge-alpha-free, ling-3.1-flash-free\n```\n\nThe list has no `nemotron-3-super-free`. It also has no `minimax-m2.5-free`, `hy3-preview-free`, `ling-2.6-flash-free` or `gpt-5-nano`.\n\n**2. Agent 0.26.11 rejects the model.** From the Hive Mind e2e matrix ([run 37030226629](https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/actions/runs/37030226629), row `agent / nemotron-3-super-free`, which installs `@link-assistant/agent@0.26.11`):\n\n```\nModel \"nemotron-3-super-free\" not found in provider \"opencode\". Available models include: ling-3.0-flash-fin-free, fledge-alpha-free, longcat-2.5-preview-free, space-bunny-free, mimo-v2.6-flash-free, nemotron-3-ultra-free, nemotron-3.5-lightning-free, big-pickle, muse-spark-1.3-contributor-free.\n```\n\n**3. Stale references at `js-v0.26.11`:**\n- `js/src/provider/opencode-zen.ts` (`'nemotron-3-super-free'` entry)\n- `js/src/provider/provider.ts` (lines 1965, 1997, 2090)\n- `js/src/config/defaults.ts:57`, default compaction cascade `(big-pickle minimax-m2.5-free nemotron-3-super-free hy3-preview-free ling-2.6-flash-free gpt-5-nano same)`\n- `FREE_MODELS.md` (lines 24, 43, 122), `MODELS.md` (lines 37, 89, 117), `js/README.md:200`\n\n## Expected\n\n- The free model lists, the documentation and the default compaction cascade contain only models the provider currently serves. Candidates are `nemotron-3-ultra-free` and `nemotron-3.5-lightning-free`.\n- A check catches drift between the hardcoded free list and `https://opencode.ai/zen/v1/models`, so the next withdrawal is caught before users hit it.\n\n## Downstream\n\nHive Mind's default agent model and its free control row (hive-mind#2324) follow Agent's free-model list. Hive Mind will move off `nemotron-3-super-free` once Agent names a replacement.\n\n0\n250:  opencode: ['grok', 'gpt4o', FORMAL_AI_MODEL_ALIAS],\n253:  agent: ['nemotron-3-super-free', 'minimax-m2.5-free', 'big-pickle', 'gpt-5-nano', 'glm-5-free', 'deepseek-r1-free', FORMAL_AI_MODEL_ALIAS],\n260: * @returns {string} Description like \"Model to use (for claude: opus, sonnet, ...; for agent: ...)\"",
        "is_error": false
      }
    ]
  },
