        "content": "Web search results for query: \"Gemini CLI model aliases auto pro flash flash-lite documentation\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"computingforgeeks.com\",\"url\":\"https://computingforgeeks.com/?p=167354\"},{\"title\":\"hexdocs.pm\",\"url\":\"https://hexdocs.pm/gemini_cli_sdk/models.html\"},{\"title\":\"gemini cli cheat sheet\",\"url\":\"https://computingforgeeks.com/gemini-cli-cheat-sheet/\"},{\"title\":\"www.mintlify.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.mintlify.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/concepts/models\"},{\"title\":\"# Gemini CLI model selection (`/model` command)\",\"url\":\"https://geminicli.com/docs/cli/model.md\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini CLI model selection (`/model` command)\",\"url\":\"https://geminicli.com/docs/cli/model\"},{\"title\":\"how to fix model switching\",\"url\":\"https://inventivehq.com/knowledge-base/gemini/how-to-fix-model-switching\"},{\"title\":\"gemini cli\",\"url\":\"https://docs.apiyi.com/en/scenarios/programming/gemini-cli\"},{\"title\":\"gemini cli\",\"url\":\"https://skills.sh/quantmind-br/skills/gemini-cli\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's the documentation for Gemini CLI model aliases:\n\n## Model Aliases\n\nThe Gemini CLI supports these aliases: auto, pro, flash, flash-lite.\n\n### Alias Resolution\n\nThe aliases resolve as follows:\n- **auto**: gemini-2.5-pro (or gemini-3-pro-preview if previews enabled) - Default. Sensible balance.\n- **pro**: gemini-2.5-pro / gemini-3-pro-preview - Complex reasoning, refactor, code review.\n- **flash**: gemini-2.5-flash - Fast everyday tasks.\n- **flash-lite**: gemini-2.5-flash-lite - Cheap, simple lookups.\n\n### Model Configuration\n\nYou can configure your default model in several ways with this precedence order: --model flag (highest priority), GEMINI_MODEL environment variable, model.name in settings.json, or Default (auto).\n\n### Command-Line Usage\n\nYou can override the model using the -m, --model flag with aliases or full model IDs.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."
